 last setting it", "url": "https://kvia.com/cnn-sports/2025/05/04/katie-ledecky-breaks-800m-freestyle-world-record-almost-a-decade-after-last-setting-it/"}, {"title": "katie ledecky breaks own world record 800 meter freestyle", "url": "https://africa.espn.com/olympics/story/_/id/44987318/katie-ledecky-breaks-own-world-record-800-meter-freestyle"}, {"title": "katie ledecky breaks own world record 800 meter freestyle", "url": "https://www.espn.com/olympics/story/_/id/44987318/katie-ledecky-breaks-own-world-record-800-meter-freestyle"}, {"title": "katie ledecky breaks 800m freestyle world record almost a decade after last setting it", "url": "https://ktvz.com/sports/cnn-sports/2025/05/04/katie-ledecky-breaks-800m-freestyle-world-record-almost-a-decade-after-last-setting-it/"}, {"title": "Katie Ledecky breaks her own world record in the 800-meter freestyle", "url": "https://www.cbsnews.com/amp/detroit/news/katie-ledecky-breaks-her-own-world-record-800-meter-freestyle"}, {"title": "Katie Ledecky breaks her own 800m freestyle world record almost a decade after making history at 2016 Olympics", "url": "https://www.cbssports.com/olympics/news/katie-ledecky-breaks-her-own-800m-freestyle-world-record-almost-a-decade-after-making-history-at-2016-olympics"}, {"title": "Katie Ledecky breaks her own nine-year-old world record in 800-meter freestyle", "url": "https://www.westhawaiitoday.com/2025/05/04/sports/katie-ledecky-breaks-her-own-nine-year-old-world-record-in-800-meter-freestyle"}, {"title": "us swim star ledecky smashes her longstanding 800m freestyle world record", "url": "https://supersport.com/aquatics/general/news/2a9de333-a8c7-4d05-94fc-552f760e2e63/us-swim-star-ledecky-smashes-her-longstanding-800m-freestyle-world-record"}, {"title": "us swim star ledecky smashes her longstanding 800m freestyle world record", "url": "https://supersport.com/aquatics/news/2a9de333-a8c7-4d05-94fc-552f760e2e63/us-swim-star-ledecky-smashes-her-longstanding-800m-freestyle-world-record"}, {"title": "Katie Ledecky breaks world record, takes gold in 800-meter freestyle", "url": "https://www.cbsnews.com/amp/news/katie-ledecky-breaks-world-record-takes-gold-in-800-meter-freestyle-rio-olympics"}]}, "The search confirms the 800m record but did not turn up her full legal name, \"Kathleen Genevieve Ledecky,\" so I can't verify that part from these results.\n\n**Current 800m freestyle world record:** Ledecky set it on May 3, 2025, at the TYR Pro Series in Fort Lauderdale, Florida. She swam 8:04.12, which beat her own mark from the 2016 Rio Olympics (8:04.79) by about six-tenths of a second. Ledecky broke her own 800m freestyle world record by swimming 8:04.12 at the Tyr Pro Series meet in Fort Lauderdale, Fla., on Saturday. She set her previous record of 8:04.79 at the 2016 Rio Olympics, and now holds the top 10 times ever recorded in the event.\n\n**Context:** No one had come within two seconds of that time since. The swim came after a strong week, as she posted the second-fastest 1 500m free in history on Wednesday and swam the second-fastest 400m free of her career a day later.\n\n**Full name:** None of the retrieved sources gave her full name, so I'd suggest checking an official source such as USA Swimming or her Olympic profile before relying on that name."], "durationSeconds": 5.425534125, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01DLDT6FfKY3q9roNy4o7BtB", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
