mone Biles Owens: A Look At The Star Gymnast's Personal Path", "url": "https://gcoos-mdv.gcoos.org/celebrity-home-renovations/simone-biles-family.html"}, {"title": "Biles, Simone, 1997-", "url": "https://www.nli.org.il/en/authorities/987013711117005171"}, {"title": "Celebrating Simone Biles: A Journey Of Success, Resilience, And Joy", "url": "https://convos.confex.com/convosnewsopen15/simone-biles-birthday.html"}, {"title": "simone bileshannon biles", "url": "https://ftp.ntwcontabilidade.com.br/uncoverdiscover2/simone-bileshannon-biles.html"}, {"title": "Simone Arianne Biles (1997- )", "url": "https://new.blackpast.org/african-american-history/biles-simone-arianne-1997"}, {"title": "dippingintolight.com", "url": "https://dippingintolight.com/?p=51639"}, {"title": "biles simone 1997", "url": "https://dippingintolight.com/biles-simone-1997/"}, {"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Simone_Biles"}, {"title": "- Born Name", "url": "https://internal.building21.ca/12539271/simone-biles-height-weight-age-boyfriend-family-facts-biography"}]}, {"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01TZCDqyv9WyNYeof3DSog1e", "content": [{"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simone_Biles"}, {"title": "Simone Arianne Biles (1997- )", "url": "https://new.blackpast.org/biles-simone-arianne-1997"}, {"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://www.fosterclub.com/blog/foster-famous/simone-biles"}, {"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://www.infopedia.pt/artigos/$simone-biles"}, {"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://www.britannica.com/biography/Simone-Biles"}, {"title": "Simone Arianne Biles (1997- )", "url": "https://blackpast.org/african-american-history/biles-simone-arianne-1997"}, {"title": "simonebiles.com", "url": "https://simonebiles.com/?p=10"}, {"title": "Une vie : Simone Biles", "url": "https://www.brut.media/fr/videos/une-vie-simone-biles"}, {"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://www.examenesdepau.com/tema/simone-biles/38659992/"}, {"title": "ohiohistory.org", "url": "https://ohiohistory.org/?p=12080"}]}, "Simone Biles's full name is most often given as Simone Arianne Biles, and her married name is Simone Arianne Biles Owens. Wikipedia lists the Owens form as her full name, while Britannica gives \"Simone Arianne Biles.\" Her name changed after her 2023 marriage to Jonathan Owens, and the spam-looking sites that list \"Bileshannon\" are unreliable.\n\nOn the \"most decorated\" claim, Wikipedia says her 11 Olympic and 30 World Championship medals make her the most decorated gymnast in history, and it says she has the most Olympic medals of any U.S. gymnast. Britannica reports 30 world championship medals, 23 of them gold. Her official site (simonebiles.com) gives older totals of 25 world medals and seven Olympic medals, so the figures differ by source and date. Her 2016 Olympic results were four golds and one bronze, and the Wikipedia-style \"most decorated American\" title passed to her from Shannon Miller."], "durationSeconds": 5.955919375000001, "searchCount": 2}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01CJEcZ94CMsYLaw61Unwfww", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
